I go to the left and then straight ahead.
"Go straight ahead to the water," I think.
The man is right.
Up ahead I finally see the water.
That is the Spree.
I walk straight ahead to the bridge.
I walk across the bridge.
Now I am on Museum Island.
I stop.
I look up.
The buildings here are huge.
I see the museums.
They are very old and really beautiful.
Next to them stands the Berliner Dom.
The Dom is a very big church.
I take my mobile phone out of my backpack.
I take a photo.
Sabine is right.
This island is fantastic.
